# QuestionsForm

Multi-step wizard form component that renders questions one at a time. Supports input, select, and upload question types with configurable validation and value change callbacks.

## Overview

The QuestionsForm provides a wizard-style UI for collecting user input through a sequence of questions. It integrates with `react-hook-form` for form state and validation, and uses `EtScreen` for consistent layout (title, description, content, footer).

## Component Tree

```
QuestionsForm
├── EtScreen
│   ├── EtScreen.ScrollView
│   │   └── EtScreen.Content
│   │       ├── EtScreen.Content.Title (resolved question text)
│   │       ├── EtScreen.Content.Subtitle (resolved subText)
│   │       └── EtScreen.Content.Body
│   │           ├── QuestionHeader (optional: title, img)
│   │           └── View (question body)
│   │               └── [InputQuestion | SelectQuestion | Upload placeholder]
│   └── EtScreen.Footer
│       ├── EtScreen.Footer.Primary (submit)
│       └── footerExtra
```

### Subcomponents

| Component                | Purpose                                                                                              |
| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **QuestionHeader**       | Renders optional title, description text, and image. Returns null if no props provided.              |
| **QuestionMessageBox**   | Renders info/warning/error message box with type-based colors, optional border and icon.             |
| **SelectQuestion**       | Renders options using `EtSelectionTileGroup` for single-select and toggle-input multi-select flows, with fallback to `SelectQuestionOption` where needed. |
| **SelectQuestionOption** | Legacy/fallback option renderer for non-tile flows. Supports check, checkBox, checkRound, and chips styles. |
| **AnimatedContainer**    | Wraps children in `Animated.View` with FadeIn/FadeOut transitions (400ms).                           |

