## SelectQuestion

Renders single-select or multi-select question with style-aware rendering:

- Single-select `check`/`checkBox`/`checkRound` use `EtSelectionTileGroup`
- Multi-select `checkRound` uses toggle-input rendering (`ToggleSwitchSelectGroup`)
- Other styles fall back to `SelectQuestionOption`

Text resolution is provided via `QuestionsFormTextProvider` context.

### Props

| Prop            | Type                                            | Required | Description                                        |
| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| `question`      | `OptionsQuestion`                               | Yes      | The options question to render                     |
| `control`       | `Control<QuestionsFormValues>`                  | Yes      | React Hook Form control instance                   |
| `allQuestions`  | `Question[]`                                    | No       | Full set of questions (for conditional visibility) |
| `getFieldName`  | `(q: Question) => string`                       | Yes      | RHF-safe field name for the question (see **React Hook Form field names** below) |
| `getFieldRules` | `(q: Question) => RegisterOptions \| undefined` | Yes      | Returns react-hook-form rules for the question     |

### Variants

- **Single-select tile group**: One option at a time via `EtSelectionTileGroup`.
- **Multi-select toggle-input**: `checkRound` options rendered as toggle rows, supports inline input for one inner input question.
- **Legacy fallback**: Original `SelectQuestionOption` rendering path for styles not covered by tile group/toggle-input.

### Usage

```tsx
<SelectQuestion question={optionsQuestion} control={control} getFieldName={getFieldName} getFieldRules={getFieldRules} />
```

