## SelectQuestionOption

Individual option card for select questions. Supports four visual styles: `check` (chevron on right), `checkBox` (square on left), `checkRound` (round on left), `chips` (pill/chip-style tag). Text resolution is provided via `QuestionsFormTextProvider` context.

### Props

| Prop         | Type                               | Required | Description                                                 |
| ------------ | ---------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `option`     | `QuestionOption`                   | Yes      | The option data                                             |
| `isSelected` | `boolean`                          | Yes      | Whether the option is currently selected                    |
| `style`      | `QuestionOptionStyle`              | Yes      | Visual style: `check`, `checkBox`, `checkRound`, or `chips` |
| `onPress`    | `(option: QuestionOption) => void` | Yes      | Called when the option is pressed                           |

### Variants

| Style        | Description                                         |
| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `check`      | Chevron icon on right when selected (single-select) |
| `checkBox`   | Square checkbox on left (single-select)             |
| `checkRound` | Round checkbox on left (multi-select)               |
| `chips`      | Pill/chip-style toggleable tag (multi-select)       |

### States

- **Default**: Unselected, tappable
- **Selected**: Shows selection indicator per style
- **Disabled**: Dimmed, non-interactive (`option.disabled`)

### Usage

```tsx
<SelectQuestionOption option={opt} isSelected={isSelected(opt)} style="checkBox" onPress={handleOptionPress} />
```

