## QuestionsForm.Submit

Compound submit footer used by production callers (preferred over the legacy top-level `onSubmit` / `submitLabel`). Render as a child of `QuestionsForm`:

```tsx
<QuestionsForm config={config}>
  <QuestionsForm.Submit onSubmit={handleSubmit} isAutoSubmit={isAutoSubmit} label="Next" />
</QuestionsForm>
```

### Props

| Prop           | Type                                                                                                                    | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `onSubmit`     | `(values: QuestionsFormValues, meta?: QuestionsFormSubmitMeta) => void`                                                  | Yes      | Called when the form is submitted with valid values (canonical decoded keys). `meta.isAutoSubmit` is `true` for tap-to-advance auto-submit, `false` for button press / imperative `ref.submit()` |
| `isAutoSubmit` | `(question: Question, values: QuestionsFormValues, isValid: boolean, isDirty: boolean) => boolean`                      | No       | When returns true, hides the submit button and auto-submits when valid. After the first auto-submit, further value changes switch to manual mode. Prefer the shared `isAutoSubmit` util.                  |
| `label`        | `string`                                                                                                                | No       | Label for the submit button                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| `loading`      | `boolean`                                                                                                               | No       | Externally-controlled loading state. When provided, overrides the internal press-driven loader. When omitted, the button shows a loader from press until the question changes.                            |
| `children`     | `ReactNode`                                                                                                             | No       | Extra content rendered below the submit button                                                                                                                                                              |

