## QuestionsFormRef (Imperative Handle)

When using `QuestionsForm` with a ref, the following methods and properties are exposed:

| Member      | Type                        | Description                                                      |
| ----------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `isValid`   | `boolean`                   | Whether the form is currently valid                              |
| `getValues` | `() => QuestionsFormValues` | Returns current values keyed by **canonical** question id (or `text` when `textAsKeys`); same shape as `onSubmit` / context `getValues` |
| `submit`    | `() => void`                | Triggers validation and, if valid, calls legacy `onSubmit` with the same decoded value map as `getValues()` |

